{"id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-graph.md","title":"Graph","display":"df-graph — Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-graph","aliases":["58-df-graph","Graph"],"display":"df-graph — Graph","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-graph</span><span>Graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph — Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,X,E,v,d\\in V\">\\(G,X,E,v,d\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]^2\\in V\">\\([X]^2\\in V\\)</span> (two-element-subset family defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S,\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S,\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (degree relation defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)\\)</span> 为图及其顶点上的二元偏函数；与三元关系按元数区分。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}two\\text{-}subsets} \\vdash [X]^2\\coloneqq\\{e\\subseteq X:\\exists v,w\\in X\\;(v\\neq w\\land e=\\{v,w\\})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}two\\text{-}subsets} \\vdash [X]^2\\coloneqq\\{e\\subseteq X:\\exists v,w\\in X\\;(v\\neq w\\land e=\\{v,w\\})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,E\\in V\\;(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq [X]^2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,E\\in V\\;(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq [X]^2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}simple\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}simple\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\operatorname{Degree}_S(d,v,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land v\\in X\\land d=|\\{e\\in E:v\\in e\\}|\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\operatorname{Degree}_S(d,v,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land v\\in X\\land d=|\\{e\\in E:v\\in e\\}|\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land v\\in X\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)\\coloneqq |\\{e\\in E:v\\in e\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land v\\in X\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)\\coloneqq |\\{e\\in E:v\\in e\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom uses the undirected simple-graph convention; every edge is a two-element subset of the vertex carrier.</li>\n<li>The carrier is written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, so it is no longer confused with the ambient universe symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>; degree is guarded by a graph presentation and vertex membership.</li>\n<li><code>SimpleGraph_S</code> is retained as a compatibility alias for <code>Graph_S</code>.</li>\n<li>Complete graph: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_n\">\\(K_n\\)</span> has all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\binom{n}{2}\">\\(\\binom{n}{2}\\)</span> edges</li>\n<li>Eulerian: closed walk using each edge exactly once</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diestel, Graph Theory</li>\n<li>West, Introduction to Graph Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,X,E,v,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"[X]^2\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S,\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}two\\text{-}subsets} \\vdash [X]^2\\coloneqq\\{e\\subseteq X:\\exists v,w\\in X\\;(v\\neq w\\land e=\\{v,w\\})\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,E\\in V\\;(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq [X]^2)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}simple\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}graph\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\operatorname{Degree}_S(d,v,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land v\\in X\\land d=|\\{e\\in E:v\\in e\\}|\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq[X]^2\\land v\\in X\\ \\to\\\n\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G)\\coloneqq |\\{e\\in E:v\\in e\\}|.","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"K_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\binom{n}{2}","display":false}],"bytes":1897,"backlinks":[{"id":"861348292d148d1b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleGraph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])"},{"id":"764ea751448e1624","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])"},{"id":"a234753e40770d41","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])"},{"id":"0c27ac12f58e97df","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depend